### 乳品配送站-订奶变更与路线调整系统 API 请求示例
### 服务地址: http://localhost:3000

### 员工ID说明:
### 站点文员: staff-clerk-1 (王文员)
### 配送员1: staff-delivery-1 (李配送)
### 配送员2: staff-delivery-2 (张配送)
### 客服: staff-cs-1 (赵客服)

### 客户ID说明:
### cust-1 陈阿姨, cust-2 刘大爷, cust-3 张女士, cust-4 王先生, cust-5 李奶奶

### ========================================
### 1. 默认列表（今天要办 + 已拖延 + 刚退回）
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/default

### ========================================
### 2. 我的待办 - 站点文员
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/my-todo?staffId=staff-clerk-1&staffRole=station_clerk

### ========================================
### 3. 我的待办 - 配送员李配送
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/my-todo?staffId=staff-delivery-1&staffRole=delivery_staff

### ========================================
### 4. 我的待办 - 配送员张配送
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/my-todo?staffId=staff-delivery-2&staffRole=delivery_staff

### ========================================
### 5. 我的待办 - 客服
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/my-todo?staffId=staff-cs-1&staffRole=customer_service

### ========================================
### 6. 查询所有订奶变更列表
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes

### ========================================
### 7. 获取订奶变更详情
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-2

### ========================================
### 8. 创建订奶变更 - 客户要求增加产品
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-3",
  "changeType": "add_product",
  "changeDetail": "孩子高考期间加订营养奶",
  "oldProduct": "鲜牛奶",
  "oldQuantity": 3,
  "newProduct": "鲜牛奶+营养奶",
  "newQuantity": 4,
  "oldRouteId": "route-1",
  "oldRouteName": "城东A线",
  "assignedToId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "remark": "孩子最近学习压力大，加订一瓶营养奶",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-06-08",
  "supplementRemark": "持续到6月20日高考结束"
}

### ========================================
### 9. 处理订奶变更 - 文员受理 mc-3
### 状态流转: pending_clerk -> clerk_processing
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "targetStatus": "clerk_processing",
  "remark": "已核实客户信息，正在联系城西路线"
}

### ========================================
### 10. 处理订奶变更 - 文员转配送员确认 mc-3
### 状态流转: clerk_processing -> pending_delivery
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "targetStatus": "pending_delivery",
  "assignedToId": "staff-delivery-1",
  "newRouteId": "route-3",
  "newRouteName": "城西线",
  "routeAdjustReason": "跨区变更，从城东A线调整到城西线",
  "remark": "已确认城西线可配送，请配送员核对"
}

### ========================================
### 11. 处理订奶变更 - 配送员执行 mc-4
### 状态流转: pending_delivery -> delivery_in_progress
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-4/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-delivery-2",
  "targetStatus": "delivery_in_progress",
  "remark": "已确认库存，下周一开始暂停配送"
}

### ========================================
### 12. 处理订奶变更 - 配送员完成 mc-5
### 状态流转: delivery_in_progress -> completed
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-5/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-delivery-2",
  "targetStatus": "completed",
  "remark": "已告知客户，今晚开始加送酸奶",
  "supplementRemark": "客户表示满意"
}

### ========================================
### 13. 处理订奶变更 - 配送员退回 mc-4
### 状态流转: pending_delivery -> returned
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-4/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-delivery-2",
  "targetStatus": "returned",
  "returnReason": "need_clerk_confirm",
  "returnDetail": "暂停时间与库存盘点时间冲突，请文员确认具体日期",
  "remark": "下周刚好是月度盘点，需要确认具体暂停起始日"
}

### ========================================
### 14. 处理订奶变更 - 客服处理 mc-6
### 状态流转: pending_customer_service -> customer_service_processing
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-6/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-cs-1",
  "targetStatus": "customer_service_processing",
  "remark": "正在联系客户沟通可选时间"
}

### ========================================
### 15. 处理订奶变更 - 客服转回文员 mc-6
### 状态流转: customer_service_processing -> pending_clerk
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-6/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-cs-1",
  "targetStatus": "pending_clerk",
  "assignedToId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "remark": "客户同意改为6:45，请文员重新协调路线",
  "newDeliveryTime": "06:45",
  "supplementRemark": "客户表示6:45也可以，只要能在7点前送到"
}

### ========================================
### 16. 单独分配/调整路线
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/assign-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "newRouteId": "route-3",
  "newRouteName": "城西线",
  "routeAdjustReason": "客户搬到城西，调整到城西线",
  "remark": "调整完成，已通知配送员"
}

### ========================================
### 17. 获取操作日志
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-6/logs

### ========================================
### 18. 获取路线调整历史
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/route-histories

### ========================================
### 19. 订奶变更回看（详情 + 日志 + 路线历史）
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-6/review
